{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.md","line":484,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.tex#lem:dc-ch7-3-3","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-2-8]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-length-expansion]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-relatively-compact-lift]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-local-lift]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-path-lifting]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-lift-unique]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-chart-length-finite]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-closed-image]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.tex","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3","line":854,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[expansion $\\Rightarrow$ covering map]\n\n  \\label{lem:dc-ch7-3-3}\n\n  \\uses{thm:dc-ch7-2-8, lem:dc-ch7-3-3-length-expansion, lem:dc-ch7-3-3-relatively-compact-lift, lem:dc-ch7-3-3-local-lift, lem:dc-ch7-3-3-path-lifting, lem:dc-ch7-3-3-lift-unique, lem:dc-ch7-3-3-chart-length-finite, lem:dc-ch7-3-3-closed-image}\n\n  \\dcref{ch7:3.3}\nLet $M$ be a complete Riemannian manifold and let $f:M\\to N$ be a local\n  diffeomorphism onto a Riemannian manifold $N$ which has the following property:\n  for all $p\\in M$ and for all $v\\in T_pM$, we have $|df_p(v)|\\ge|v|$. Then $f$ is a\n  covering map.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\n\\sketch Path lifting and uniqueness give local trivializations over points in the image; the closed-image result supplies a neighborhood disjoint from the image at points outside it. Thus every point has an evenly covered neighborhood and $f$ is a covering map.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[expansion <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Rightarrow $\">$\\Rightarrow $</span> covering map] <p></p><span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368372d332d33\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23thm%3Adc-ch7-2-8\">↗ thm:dc-ch7-2-8</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-3-length-expansion\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-3-length-expansion</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-3-relatively-compact-lift\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-3-relatively-compact-lift</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-3-local-lift\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-3-local-lift</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-3-path-lifting\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-3-path-lifting</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-3-lift-unique\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-3-lift-unique</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-3-chart-length-finite\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-3-chart-length-finite</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-3-closed-image\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-3-closed-image</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch7:3.3</span></span>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> be a complete Riemannian manifold and let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f:M\\to N$\">$f:M\\to N$</span> be a local diffeomorphism onto a Riemannian manifold <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$N$\">$N$</span> which has the following property: for all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p\\in M$\">$p\\in M$</span> and for all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v\\in T_pM$\">$v\\in T_pM$</span>, we have <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$|df_p(v)|\\ge |v|$\">$|df_p(v)|\\ge |v|$</span>. Then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f$\">$f$</span> is a covering map.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch Path lifting and uniqueness give local trivializations over points in the image; the closed-image result supplies a neighborhood disjoint from the image at points outside it. Thus every point has an evenly covered neighborhood and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f$\">$f$</span> is a covering map. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-closed-image","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-simplyconnected","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-2-8","title":"thm:dc-ch7-2-8","label":"thm:dc-ch7-2-8"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-length-expansion","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-length-expansion","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-length-expansion"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-relatively-compact-lift","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-relatively-compact-lift","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-relatively-compact-lift"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-local-lift","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-local-lift","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-local-lift"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-path-lifting","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-path-lifting","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-path-lifting"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-lift-unique","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-lift-unique","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-lift-unique"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-chart-length-finite","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-chart-length-finite","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-chart-length-finite"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3-closed-image","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-closed-image","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3-closed-image"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifol